        "content": "## WF-08 Horror Audio Production & QC\nAnalyze existing real TTS → safe repair (max 2 attempts) → licensed/procedural sound assets → sound cues → 5-stem ducked mix → 2-pass master → master QC → existing visual/render chain. FAIL blocks publication. Uncertain defects export review clips and require file-bound human review. No paid generation. Existing stage URLs and job contracts remain valid.\n\nPOST /webhook/ass/wf08-audio\nHeader: as configured in 'ASS Webhook Auth'\nBody: {\"episode_id\": 1, \"run\": \"r1\", \"chat_id\": 123}\n\nIdempotent: same episode_id+run → same job.",
